\ Space Invaders on telic's sprites, keyboard and synthesizer.
\
\   ./telic examples/space-invaders.telic
\   ./telic examples/space-invaders.telic --level 4
\
\ --level n starts every new game at wave n, formation lower and firing
\ faster as if the earlier waves had been cleared.
\
\ Run it from the repository root: the art is read from
\ examples/assets/invaders.png, "Alternate Space Invaders" by WaffleKilometer
\ (https://opengameart.org/content/alternate-space-invaders, CC0), through
\ ffmpeg. The sprites are cut from the sheet with submatrix and tinted by
\ arithmetic on the packed colors.
\
\ Keys: left and right arrows move, space fires, p pauses, return starts,
\ escape quits.
\
\ The game: five rows of eleven invaders step sideways and drop a row at each
\ wall, faster as their number falls; the lowest invader in a column fires,
\ at most three shots at once; four bunkers wear away pixel by pixel under
\ shots from both sides and under the invaders themselves; a mothership
\ crosses now and then for 50 to 300 points. Invaders score 30, 20 and 10.
\ Three lives, an extra one at 1500 points. Each wave starts a row lower,
\ fires more often, and has its own colors for the invader rows, the bunkers
\ and the background, six palettes in turn. The game ends when the lives run out or an invader
\ reaches the cannon's row.
\
\ The sound: in play, the march is four descending bass notes, one per
\ formation step, so its tempo follows the formation's speed. The title
\ theme and the jingles are queued on the sequencer. The sound effects:
\   laser     a pulse and a phase-modulated sine swept down by a saw LFO
\   boom      white noise through a resonant ladder filter with a falling
\             envelope, over a fixed 110 Hz triangle
\   death     brown noise, a saw an octave down and white noise, the filter
\             swept by its envelope and a sample-and-hold LFO
\   saucer    a unison pulse whose pitch and width the LFO wobbles, panned
\             with the mothership's position
\   bonus     a phase-modulated bell with three unison copies
\ The effects chain: a light chorus and plate reverb throughout, a shimmer
\ on the title screen, the reverb opened up while the cannon explodes, and a
\ ping-pong delay while the mothership flies.

"invaders/game.telic" load

play
